         <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
          <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Detail Plattenfuge: (Auszug KABA 2020, Detail D11_5_1</span>
