    </Remark>
    <BoQCtgy ID="ID_6" RNoPart="01">
     <LblTx textWidth="9.999cm">
      <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
       <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Allgemein</span>
      </p>
     </LblTx>
     <BoQBody>
      <BoQCtgy ID="ID_7" RNoPart="01">
       <LblTx textWidth="9.999cm">
        <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
         <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Baustelleneinrichtung</span>
        </p>
       </LblTx>
       <BoQBody>
        <Itemlist>
         <Item ID="ID_8" RNoPart="0010">
          <Qty>1.000</Qty>
          <QU>Psch</QU>
          <CtlgAssign>
           <CtlgID>CtlgID_B12</CtlgID>
           <CtlgCode>101</CtlgCode>
          </CtlgAssign>
          <Description ID="DC1EC415-93AE-4ACF-B5F4-088FC55792E5">
           <StLNo Type="StLK">1910110711</StLNo>
           <CompleteText>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text textWidth="9.997cm">
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Geräte, Werkzeuge und sonstige Betriebsmittel, die zur</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">vertragsgemäßen Ausführung der Bauleistungen erforder-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">lich sind, auf die Baustelle bringen, bereitstellen und</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">soweit der Geräteeinsatz nicht gesondert vergütet</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">wird - betriebsfertig aufstellen einschl. der dafür</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">notwendigen Arbeiten. Die erforderlichen festen Anlagen</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">herstellen. Baubüros, Unterkünfte, Werkstätten, Lager-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">schuppen und dgl., soweit erforderlich, antransportie-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">ren, aufbauen und einrichten. Strom-, Wasser-, Fern-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">sprechanschluss sowie Entsorgungseinrichtungen und dgl.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">für die Baustelle, soweit erforderlich, herstellen. Bei</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bedarf Lagerplätze, sonstige Platzbefestigungen und</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wege im Baustellenbereich anlegen. Oberbodenarbeiten</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">einschl. Beseitigen von Aufwuchs für die Baustellenein-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">richtung, soweit erforderlich, ausführen. Flächen be-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">schaffen, sofern die vom AG zur Verfügung gestellten</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">nicht ausreichen. Kosten für Vorhalten, Unterhalten und</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Betreiben der Geräte, Anlagen und Einrichtungen</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">einschl. Mieten, Pacht, Gebühren und dgl. werden nicht</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit dieser Pauschale, sondern mit den Einheitspreisen</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">der betreffenden Teilleistungen vergütet. Soweit nicht</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">für bestimmte Leistungen für das Einrichten der Bau-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">stelle gesonderte Positionen im Leistungsverzeichnis</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">enthalten sind, gilt die Pauschale</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">für alle Leistungen sämtlicher Abschnitte des Leis-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">tungsverzeichnisses.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Zufahrt zur Baustelle vorhanden.</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Baustelle einrichten Sämtl.LV-Abschn. Zufahrt vorh.</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Item>
         <Item ID="ID_9" RNoPart="0020">
          <Qty>1.000</Qty>
          <QU>Psch</QU>
          <CtlgAssign>
           <CtlgID>CtlgID_B12</CtlgID>
           <CtlgCode>101</CtlgCode>
          </CtlgAssign>
          <Description ID="C89BDC2A-97B0-41BC-A8E0-DE2EAE55F24E">
           <StLNo Type="StLK">1910111201</StLNo>
           <CompleteText>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text textWidth="9.997cm">
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Baustelle von allen Geräten, Anlagen, Einrichtungen und</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">dgl. räumen. Benutzte Flächen und Wege entsprechend dem</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">ursprünglichen Zustand herrichten. Soweit nicht für</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">bestimmte Leistungen für das Räumen der Baustelle ge-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">sonderte Positionen im Leistungsverzeichnis enthalten</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">sind, gilt die Pauschale</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">für alle Leistungen sämtlicher Abschnitte des Leis-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">tungsverzeichnisses.</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Baustelle räumen Sämtl. LV-Abschn.</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Item>
         <Item ID="ID_10" RNoPart="0030">
          <Qty>1.000</Qty>
          <QU>psch</QU>
          <Description ID="BE49E918-B57B-4022-9D9E-1468EF0C53B7">
           <CompleteText>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text textWidth="9.997cm">
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Beweissicherung in Abstimmung mit AG durchführen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Beweissicherung zur Dokumentation des Zustandes der</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Baubereiche einschließlich deren Bebauung und</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Einrichtungen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Beweissicherungsverfahren vor Baubeginn im Beisein des </span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">AG durchführen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Übergabe der Beweissicherung an den AG hat vor</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Baubeginn zu erfolgen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Auf die besonderen Anforderungen an die Beweissicherung</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">der bebauten Grundstücke einschließlich aller Wege,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gebäude und sonstiger Einrichtungen wird ausdrücklich</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Hingewiesen.</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Beweissicherung</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Item>
         <Item ID="ID_11" RNoPart="0040">
          <Qty>1.000</Qty>
          <QU>psch</QU>
          <Description ID="C2DCF81F-BCEA-44D3-8BA1-71F46308F8C8">
           <CompleteText>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text textWidth="9.997cm">
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Schutz und Sicherung aller im Baubereich der</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Instandsetzungsmaßnahme befindlichen Gebäudeteile</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">einschließlich des angrenzenden Verkehrsraumes usw. vor</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Beschädigungen und Verunreinigungen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Staubschutz nach Wahl des AN während der Abbruch-,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Abtrags- und Strahlarbeiten.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Schutz- und Sicherungseinrichtungen einschließlich</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">der Abdeckungen sind ständig zu kontrollieren und zu</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">sichern.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Beschädigte Teile und Abdeckungen sind umgehend zu</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">ersetzen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Erforderliche Mehraufwendungen für Erschwernisse, die</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">sich daraus bei dem Abtrags- , Strahl-, Beton-, und</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Instandsetzungsarbeiten ergeben, sind in diese Position</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">einzukalkulieren.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Der AN hat dabei eigenständig sich mit dem AG über den</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Schutz und Sicherung der vorhandenen Einrichtung und</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bebauung usw. abzustimmen und dessen Forderungen und</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Hinweise umzusetzen.</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Schutz- und Sicherung von Gebäudeteilen</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Item>
         <Item ID="ID_12" RNoPart="0050">
          <Qty>1.000</Qty>
          <QU>psch</QU>
          <Description ID="AEBB461B-A582-464B-B906-99DFB677362F">
           <CompleteText>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text textWidth="9.997cm">
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Schutz und Sicherung aller im Baubereich vorhandenen</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Einläufe, Rinnen und der</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">anschließenden Entwässerungsleitungen vor Strahl- und</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Abbruchgut.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Einläufe sind nach Wahl des AN durch feste</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Abdeckungen mit Abdichtungen Staub- und Wasserdicht</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">abzudecken.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Das Eindringen von Instandsetzungs- und</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Beschichtunsmaterial in die Abläufe und damit in die</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Entwässerung ist zwingend zu unterbinden.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Insbesondere dürfen keine wassergefährtenden Stoffe</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">(wie z.B. Mineralöle, Lösungsmittel, EP- Harze usw.) in</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">die Kanalisation gelangen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die sich aus dem WHG (Wasserhaushaltsgesetz)</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">insbesondere des §19 ergebenen besonderen Anforderungen</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">sind vom AN eigenständig zu beachten und auszuführen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Urkunde ist dem Angebot beizufügen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Alle für diese Maßnahmen erforderlichen Aufwendungen</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">einschließlich Material, Hilfs-und Anschlussarbeiten</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">sind in die vorliegende LV Pos. mit einzukalkulieren.</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Schutz und Sicherung der Entwässerung</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Item>
         <Item ID="ID_13" RNoPart="0060">
          <Qty>1.000</Qty>
          <QU>psch</QU>
          <Description ID="D0E9138D-8F7B-420B-9DAA-AEACBA70668F">
           <CompleteText>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text textWidth="9.997cm">
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Baustellenbeschilderung, Absperrung und Sicherung der</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Baustelle einschließlich des Absperr- und</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Sicherungsmateriales bereitstellen, aufbauen, vorhalten</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">und abbauen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Herstellung einschließlich erforderlicher</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Verankerungen, Fundamente usw..</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Absperrung und Sicherung gegen Umstürzen aus</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Witterungseinflüssen und Vandalismus sichern.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Baustellenabsicherung und Bauzäune sind</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">entsprechend der Vorschriften zu sichern und täglich zu</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">kontrollieren.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Ausführung in Absprache mit AG bzw. dessen BÜ.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Verankerungen, Fundamente sind restlos zu Beseitigen,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">in Eigentum des AN zu übernehmen und von der Baustelle</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">zu entfernen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bauzaun aus mobilen Elementen- Arbeitsstellenzaun, </span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Stützenfüße aus Beton,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">inkl. sämtlicher Verbindungen, Kupplungen und</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Verbotsbeschilderungen (min. 8 Schilder) pro</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bauabschnitt und Bauzaun.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Baustellensicherung, Bauzäune usw. entsprechend</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Technologie, Bauabschnitte und Bauablauf umsetzen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">In den Angebotspreis ist das erforderliche mehrfache</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Umsetzen der Baustellensicherung einschließlich der</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bauzäune entsprechend der Bauabschnitte einzurechnen.</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Baustellensicherung</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Item>
         <Item ID="ID_289" RNoPart="0070">
          <Qty>1.000</Qty>
          <QU>psch</QU>
          <Description ID="91E50A38-F9FD-4E85-90E3-8AD17BD13151">
           <CompleteText>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text textWidth="9.999cm">
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Dokumentationsunterlagen herstellen und liefern, </span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Dokumentationsunterlage beinhaltet neben den Fotos:</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Lieferscheine Beton </span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Lieferscheine Abdichtungsmaterialien, Wärmedämmung, usw.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Dokumentation Fremd-/Eigenüberwachung</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Fachbauleiter- / Fachunternehmererklärung</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Dokumentation Betoninstandsetzung nach RILI SIB/ </span>
               <br/>
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">  TR Instandhaltung falls erforderlich</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Bautagesberichte</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Fotodokumentation über den wesentlichen Bauablauf</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Unterlagen 2-fach digital auf Datenträger zur Bauabnahme liefern</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fotos: JPG- Datein Umfang ca. 30 Fotos pro Bauabschnitt </span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Dokumentationsunterlage einschl. Fotos herstellen</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Item>
         <Item ID="ID_16" RNoPart="0080">
          <Qty>1.000</Qty>
          <QU>psch</QU>
          <Description ID="B73D82A8-E206-4942-90D3-A824E60C96E1">
           <CompleteText>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text textWidth="9.997cm">
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Verschmutzungen im Instandsetzungsbereich sowie der</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">angrenzenden Verkehrsflächen bauabschnittsweise beseitigen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Vor Verkehrsfreigabe der Bauabschnitte ist die instand gesetzte und freizugebende Fläche zu reinigen. </span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Verkehrssicherheit darf nicht durch Verunreinigungen der beeinträchtigt sein. </span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Verschmutzungen beseitigen</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Item>
         <Item ID="ID_17" RNoPart="0090">
          <Qty>1.000</Qty>
          <QU>psch</QU>
          <Description ID="5232E34C-39DD-4C62-9C8B-00BC3AC5AF69">
           <CompleteText>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text textWidth="9.997cm">
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Baufeinreinigung der Baubereiche auf dem</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Parkdecks nach Bedarf (ggf. auch Fenster, Türen usw.)</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">nach Beendigung der einzelnen Bau-/</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Instandsetzungsabschnitte.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Baufeinreinigung betrifft sämtliche in den</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Instandsetzungsbereichen (im/ auf dem Parkdeck)</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">befindlichen Einrichtungs- und Ausrüstungsgegenstände.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Dies sind u.a. Leitungen einschließlich Kabeltrassen,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Tafeln, Lüftungskanäle, Rohrleitungen, Türen, Lampen,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Lautsprecher usw..</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Feinreinigung ist vor Freigabe des Bauabschnitts</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit dem AG abzunehmen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Auszahlung der Schlußrechnung erfolgt erst nach</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">erfolgter mängelfreier Abnahme der Feinreinigung für</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">alle Baubereich.</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Baufeinreinigung</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Item>
        </Itemlist>
       </BoQBody>
      </BoQCtgy>
      <BoQCtgy ID="ID_18" RNoPart="02">
       <LblTx textWidth="9.997cm">
        <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
         <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Verkehrssicherung</span>
        </p>
       </LblTx>
       <BoQBody>
        <Itemlist>
         <Remark ID="ID_19">
          <Description ID="875E090F-7240-4154-AD14-37266CB0E413">
           <CompleteText>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text textWidth="9.997cm">
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Verkehrssicherung nach den Vorschriften der</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Straßenverkehrsordnung in der jeweils gültigen Fassung</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">durchführen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Der Auftragnehmer hat alle für die Verkehrssicherung</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">und Verkehrsregelung im Bereich der Baustelle und ihrer</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Nebenanlagen erforderlichen Maßnahmen unter seiner</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Verantwortung durchzuführen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Anweisungen des AG sowie der Marktleitung hat er dabei zu beachten.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Der AN hat die Baustelle und ihre Nebenanlagen sowie</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">die Baustofflagerplätze vorschriftsmäßig abzuschranken,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">zu beleuchten und erforderlichenfalls zu bewachen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Baustoffe sind auf dem vom AG angegebenen</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Baustelleneinrichtungs- und Lagerflächen zu lagern.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Flächen befinden sich nicht in unmittelbarer Nähe</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">bzw. räumlichen Zusammenhang mit der Baustelle der </span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Abfahrtsrampe und auf dem Parkdeck.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die erforderlichen Maßnahmen (Beschilderung,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Aufrechterhaltung der Umleitung während der </span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Baumaßnahme etc.) für eine</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Umleitung des Verkehrs hat der AN durchzuführen und in</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">dieser Position einzukalkulieren.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Es sind reflektierende Verkehrszeichen zu verwenden und</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">gegebenenfalls Sicherungsposten zu stellen.</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>VORBEMERKUNG</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Remark>
         <Item ID="ID_20" RNoPart="0010">
          <Qty>1.000</Qty>
          <QU>Psch</QU>
          <Description ID="3B5E6B53-6959-4ACB-A826-9D5F8917DA09">
           <CompleteText>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text textWidth="9.997cm">
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Beschilderungs- und Umleitungsplan für die betreffenden</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Parkplatzflächen entsprechend des</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bauablaufplanes aufstellen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Verkehrssichere Absperrung der Baustelle nach RSA 95,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Absicherung des Kundenverkehrs auf dem</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Parkdeck während der Bauzeit.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Beschilderung der Baubereiche entsprechend der vom AG</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">bzw. dessen BÜ bestätigten Planunterlagen</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">(Verkehrszeichenplan/ Umleitungsplan) herstellen</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">(Herstellung der entsprechenden Plantafeln und</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Verkehrszeichen).</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Ordnungsgemäße Absperrung der Zufahrten gemäß StVO,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">einschließlich deren Beleuchtung, Beschilderung</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">aufbauen, unterhalten und räumen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die anfallenden Kosten (Gebühren usw.) sind in den</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Einheitspreis einzurechnen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die erforderlichen bauzeitlichen Markierungen für</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Änderungen an den Parkflächen, Verkehrsführungen,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Sperr- und Leitlinien sind einschließlich deren</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Beseitigung mit in diese LV- Pos. einzukalkulieren.</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Sperrung von Park- und Verkehrsflächen</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Item>
         <Item ID="ID_21" RNoPart="0020">
          <Qty>50.000</Qty>
          <QU>d</QU>
          <Description ID="0C3B7999-73D4-420A-BF70-81A678535AD4">
           <CompleteText>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text textWidth="9.997cm">
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Umleitungsbeschilderung, erforderliche bauzeitliche</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Markierungen von Verkehrsflächen vorhalten</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">und unterhalten.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Mindestens 1x täglich auf Beschädigung oder</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Verschmutzung kontrollieren und Sollzustand wieder</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">herstellen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Der angebotene Einheitspreis gilt unabhängig von der</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Anzahl der abgerechneten Tage.</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Unterhaltung Umleitungsbeschilderung</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Item>
         <Item ID="ID_22" RNoPart="0030">
          <Qty>40.000</Qty>
          <QU>m</QU>
          <Description ID="C6EC007C-AF89-4147-B2FA-D8BA071F2FB4">
           <CompleteText>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text textWidth="19.995cm">
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Absperrung aus Arbeitsstellenzaun rot/ weiß für</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fußgängerführung und Verkehrssicherung aufstellen,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">entsprechend Bauablauf umsetzen und beseitigen, für die</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bauzeit vorhalten, warten und betreiben.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Vorübergehende Sicherungsmaßnahmen durchführen. 70 v.H.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">des Preises werden nach Aufstellen, der Rest nach</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Beseitigen vergütet.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Arbeitsstellenzaun aus Kunststoff h = 100 cm mit</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Aufstellvorrichtung.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Mit retroreflektierender Folie der Bauart Typ 2.</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Absperrg.aus Arbeitsstellenzaun aufstellen Abspsch.</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Item>
         <Item ID="ID_23" RNoPart="0040">
          <Qty>4.000</Qty>
          <QU>St</QU>
          <CtlgAssign>
           <CtlgID>CtlgID_B12</CtlgID>
           <CtlgCode>805</CtlgCode>
          </CtlgAssign>
          <Description ID="0A831005-8287-4CE0-A19A-12F5CA8EB8F9">
           <StLNo Type="StLK">19805344112331</StLNo>
           <CompleteText>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text textWidth="19.998cm">
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Auskreuzung als vorübergehende Markierung herstellen,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">warten und instand setzen. Vorübergehende Verkehrssi-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">cherungsmaßnahmen durchführen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Als Markierungssystem aus Folie Typ I.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Strichbreite = 0,12 m.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Strichlänge = 2 x 5,00 m.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Verkehrsklasse mindestens P 5.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Markierung auf grobstrukturierter Betondecke.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Markierungsfolie entfernen. Abfall aufnehmen und der</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Verwertung nach Wahl des AN zuführen.</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Auskreuzung herstellen Typ I Breite 0,12 m Länge 2 x 5,00 m mind. P 5</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Item>
        </Itemlist>
       </BoQBody>
      </BoQCtgy>
      <BoQCtgy ID="ID_24" RNoPart="03">
       <LblTx textWidth="9.997cm">
        <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
         <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Stundenlohnarbeiten</span>
        </p>
       </LblTx>
       <BoQBody>
        <Itemlist>
         <Remark ID="ID_25">
          <Description ID="660542F5-337F-4AFC-A7B4-0B2CCE035ED4">
           <CompleteText>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text textWidth="9.997cm">
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die nachfolgenden Positionen beinhalten die Abfrage der Verrechnungssätze der am Bau eingesetzten Arbeitskräfte. </span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Ausführung von Stundenlohnarbeiten hat sich der Auftragnehmer vom AG schriftlich anweisen zu lassen. </span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Anweisung wird in 2-facher Fertigung ausgestellt und ist der Bauleitung bei der Unterzeichnung der Stundenlohnzettel vorzulegen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Stundenlohnzettel müssen eindeutig erkennen lassen:</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1.Name des Auftragnehmers (Firma)</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">2.Bezeichnung, Ort und Lage der Baustelle</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">3.Anzahl, Name und genaue Berufsbezeichnung der </span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">   im Stundenlohn beschäftigten Arbeitnehmer; die von </span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">   diesen am Tag geleistete Gesamtstundenzahl.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">4.Bezeichnung der ausgeführten Arbeiten</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">5.Menge oder Gewicht und Art etwaiger Zulieferungen, wie Material</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">6.Benutzung von Maschinen</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die vom Auftragnehmer oder seinem Bevollmächtigten unterschriebenen Stundenlohnzettel müssen für jeden Kalendertag getrennt ausgestellt sein und sind täglich der Bauleitung in doppelter Fertigung zur Anerkennung vorzulegen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Zuschläge für Überstunden-, Nacht- und Sonntagsarbeiten werden nur auf besondere Anweisung des AG bezahlt. Ein Anspruch auf die Stundenlohnarbeiten durch den Auftragnehmer besteht nicht.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bei den Stundenlohnarbeiten werden Aufsichtsstunden, Ausfall- und Wartungsstunden nicht vergütet.</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Vorbemerkung Stundenlohnarbeiten</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Remark>
         <Item ID="ID_26" RNoPart="0010">
          <Provis>WithoutTotal</Provis>
          <Qty>1.000</Qty>
          <QU>h</QU>
          <Description ID="F5861200-A250-4223-A83A-F29E86576F74">
           <StLNo Type="StLK">0310191008</StLNo>
           <CompleteText>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text textWidth="9.997cm">
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Stundenlohnarbeiten durch Arbeitskraefte auf Anordnung</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">des AG ausfuehren. Der Verrechnungssatz fuer die jewei-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">lige Arbeitskraft umfasst saemtliche Aufwendungen, ins-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">besondere den tatsaechlichen Lohn einschliesslich ver-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">moegenswirksamer Leistungen mit den Zuschlaegen fuer</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gemeinkosten (Sozialkassenbeitraege, Winterbauumlage</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">und dgl.), sowie Lohn- bzw. Gehaltsnebenkosten und Zu-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">schlaege fuer Ueberstunden. Zuschlaege fuer Nacht-,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Sonntags- und Feiertagsarbeit werden gesondert vergue-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">tet.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Baufacharbeiter (Berufsgruppe V 1).</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Verrechnungssatz fuer Arbeitskraft BFA (V 1)</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Item>
         <Item ID="ID_27" RNoPart="0020">
          <Provis>WithoutTotal</Provis>
          <Qty>1.000</Qty>
          <QU>h</QU>
          <Description ID="CB219F65-1F72-466D-A1B9-84947E424D9D">
           <StLNo Type="StLK">0310191007</StLNo>
           <CompleteText>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text textWidth="9.997cm">
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Stundenlohnarbeiten durch Arbeitskraefte auf Anordnung</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">des AG ausfuehren. Der Verrechnungssatz fuer die jewei-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">lige Arbeitskraft umfasst saemtliche Aufwendungen, ins-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">besondere den tatsaechlichen Lohn einschliesslich ver-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">moegenswirksamer Leistungen mit den Zuschlaegen fuer</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gemeinkosten (Sozialkassenbeitraege, Winterbauumlage</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">und dgl.), sowie Lohn- bzw. Gehaltsnebenkosten und Zu-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">schlaege fuer Ueberstunden. Zuschlaege fuer Nacht-,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Sonntags- und Feiertagsarbeit werden gesondert vergue-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">tet.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gehobene Baufacharbeiter (Berufsgruppe IV).</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Verrechnungssatz fuer Arbeitskraft Geh. BFA (IV)</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Item>
         <Item ID="ID_28" RNoPart="0030">
          <Provis>WithoutTotal</Provis>
          <Qty>1.000</Qty>
          <QU>h</QU>
          <Description ID="2BBA25B8-DC61-4435-956A-2096CB84FD9F">
           <StLNo Type="StLK">0310191004</StLNo>
           <CompleteText>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text textWidth="9.997cm">
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Stundenlohnarbeiten durch Arbeitskraefte auf Anordnung</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">des AG ausfuehren. Der Verrechnungssatz fuer die jewei-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">lige Arbeitskraft umfasst saemtliche Aufwendungen, ins-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">besondere den tatsaechlichen Lohn einschliesslich ver-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">moegenswirksamer Leistungen mit den Zuschlaegen fuer</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gemeinkosten (Sozialkassenbeitraege, Winterbauumlage</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">und dgl.), sowie Lohn- bzw. Gehaltsnebenkosten und Zu-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">schlaege fuer Ueberstunden. Zuschlaege fuer Nacht-,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Sonntags- und Feiertagsarbeit werden gesondert vergue-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">tet.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Spezialbaufacharbeiter (Berufsgruppe III 1).</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Verrechnungssatz fuer Arbeitskraft SpezialBFA(III 1)</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Item>
         <Item ID="ID_29" RNoPart="0040">
          <Provis>WithoutTotal</Provis>
          <Qty>1.000</Qty>
          <QU>h</QU>
          <Description ID="76BF6EEC-5BB4-4B20-8462-4FD7A6797FC6">
           <StLNo Type="StLK">0310191001</StLNo>
           <CompleteText>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text textWidth="9.997cm">
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Stundenlohnarbeiten durch Arbeitskraefte auf Anordnung</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">des AG ausfuehren. Der Verrechnungssatz fuer die jewei-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">lige Arbeitskraft umfasst saemtliche Aufwendungen, ins-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">besondere den tatsaechlichen Lohn einschliesslich ver-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">moegenswirksamer Leistungen mit den Zuschlaegen fuer</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gemeinkosten (Sozialkassenbeitraege, Winterbauumlage</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">und dgl.), sowie Lohn- bzw. Gehaltsnebenkosten und Zu-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">schlaege fuer Ueberstunden. Zuschlaege fuer Nacht-,</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Sonntags- und Feiertagsarbeit werden gesondert vergue-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">tet.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Poliere, Schachtmeister oder dgl.</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Verrechnungssatz fuer Arbeitskraft Poliere</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Item>
        </Itemlist>
       </BoQBody>
      </BoQCtgy>
     </BoQBody>
    </BoQCtgy>
    <BoQCtgy ID="ID_30" RNoPart="02">
     <LblTx textWidth="9.999cm">
      <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
       <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Allgemeine Instandsetzungsarbeiten</span>
      </p>
     </LblTx>
     <BoQBody>
      <BoQCtgy ID="ID_31" RNoPart="01">
       <LblTx textWidth="9.999cm">
        <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
         <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">dauerelast. Fugenfüllung erneuern</span>
        </p>
       </LblTx>
       <BoQBody>
        <Itemlist>
         <Item ID="ID_32" RNoPart="0010">
          <Qty>65.000</Qty>
          <QU>m</QU>
          <Description ID="4597D765-58C4-44B1-8A65-6ACE962A8135">
           <StLNo Type="StLK">1212301699222311</StLNo>
           <CompleteText>
            <ComplTSA>Yes</ComplTSA>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text textWidth="9.997cm">
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fugenfüllung entfernen. Fugenflanken für Neuverfüllung</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">vorbereiten.</span>
              </p>
              <TextComplement MarkLbl="21" Kind="Owner" ArtChrIdent="0">
               <ComplCaption>
                <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fuge </span>
               </ComplCaption>
               <ComplBody>
                <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">zwischen Betonfahrbahnplatten</span>
               </ComplBody>
               <ComplTail>
                <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"> </span>
               </ComplTail>
              </TextComplement>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <TextComplement MarkLbl="31" Kind="Owner" ArtChrIdent="0">
               <ComplCaption>
                <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fugenfüllung </span>
               </ComplCaption>
               <ComplBody>
                <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">dauerelastische Fugenmasse aufPolysulfidbasis, z.B. Sika Flex o.ä.</span>
               </ComplBody>
               <ComplTail>
                <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"> </span>
               </ComplTail>
              </TextComplement>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fugenflanken = Beton und Stahl.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fugenbreite über 10 bis 15 mm.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fülltiefe über 10 bis 20 mm.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fugenfüllung ausschneiden mit beidseitigem Flanken-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">schnitt.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Ausführung in Teilabschnitten.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Ausgebaute Stoffe der Verwertung nach Wahl des AN zu-</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">führen.</span>
              </p>
             </Text>
            </DetailTxt>
            <OutlineText>
             <OutlTxt>
              <TextOutlTxt>
               <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
                <span>Fugenfüllung entfernen Fla. Beton/Stahl Breite 10-15 mm Tiefe 10-20...</span>
               </p>
              </TextOutlTxt>
             </OutlTxt>
            </OutlineText>
           </CompleteText>
          </Description>
         </Item>
         <Item ID="ID_33" RNoPart="0020">
          <Qty>65.000</Qty>
          <QU>m</QU>
          <Description ID="D96CAF2E-2F83-43CA-B3C6-96BE8823852D">
           <CompleteText>
            <DetailTxt>
             <Text textWidth="9.997cm">
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Raumfugen mit Drainagefunktion einschließlich elastischer Verfugung herstellen.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Herstellung gemäß KABA PFU1, Ausführungsart 2.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Zur gezielten Aufnahme von Formveränderungen des Betonbelages sowie zur Ausbildung</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">von Drainagekanälen sind die Raumfugen durchgehend mind. 15 mm breit, auszuführen, maximale Fugenbreite 30 mm.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Elastische Verfugung Bestehend aus elastischem 1-k-PUR-Dichtstoff mit einer zulässigen Gesamtverformung von 25 %, mit</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">geschlossenzelliger PE-Schnur unterlegen, oben bündig mit den Fahrbahnbelägen, nach Werkvorschrift einbringen. Die Tiefe</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">des eingebauten Dichtstoffes muss der Fugenbreite entsprechen, z. B. Material Sikaflex- Pro 3 WF oder gleichwertig.</span>
              </p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"/>
              <p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Skizze Betonplattenfuge KABA D11_5_1:</span>
               <br/>
               <image width="151" Type="image/png" Encoding="base64">iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAJcAAACnCAIAAACTh1mDAAAABGdBTUEAALGPC/xhBQAAPfRJ
